# DRC-RO-CELL-1: A vendor-GDS child (GDS_FILE property, read from input/) and a non-editable child, both with violations; modified flags after catchup.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load input/vendor
load input/locked
cellname writeable locked false
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell vendor
box 50 0 50 0
getcell locked
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
cellname list modified
cellname flags vendor
cellname flags locked
save top
